"── §65 · the context fills — a capacity beside an operation, and the head that stops
· the context is a CAPACITY — a budget being spent, and it does not animate
    ctx ######################################-- 94%  94/100

· the compaction is an OPERATION — segmented, active, and §036's head above it
    . compacting (4s : 3 of 5 turns)
    ###############################--------------------- 60%

· and when it stops the bar goes and the delta stays — one grammar, not two specimens
    + 3 turns compacted : 10.7k → 0.9k tok

── §11 · a mention is a chip — the parts cross the seam and the label does not
· painted — the ground says chip
   80 │summarise  parse.ts : 184L  for me│
   20 │summarise │
      │ parse.ts : 184L  fo│
      │r me│

· 1-bit — the bracket says it instead
   80 │summarise [parse.ts : 184L] for me│
   20 │summarise │
      │[parse.ts : 184L] fo│
      │r me│

· and what leaves the prompt is the content, never the label
  │<the file>│

── §18 · focus on things that are not rows — a choice's two channels, and a control's three states
· a choice — the MARK and the WEIGHT carry chosen, the WASH carries focus, and the label is part of the shape
  at rest
    .................................................... scale  @ linear  * log  @ log2
    .................WWWWW.............................. weight
  focused on \`linear\` — NOT chosen: the mark did not move
    .......AAAAAAAA..................................... scale  @ linear  * log  @ log2
      A = bg 48;2;46;46;46
    .................WWWWW.............................. weight
  focused on \`log\` — chosen: the same wash, the same mark
    .................AAAAA.............................. scale  @ linear  * log  @ log2
      A = bg 48;2;46;46;46
    .................WWWWW.............................. weight
  a checkbox, on
    .................................................... + run the suite after each edit
    WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW..................... weight
  a checkbox, off — ⏎ toggled it
    .................................................... x run the suite after each edit
    .................................................... weight

· a control — three states, three mechanisms, and the VALUE is none of them
  at rest
    .................................................... learning rate  +------------*----------------+  3e-4
  focused — the wash covers label, track and value as one control
    AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA learning rate  +------------*----------------+  3e-4
      A = bg 48;2;46;46;46
  inside — weight and a painted handle, and the row is the same width
