· the compaction is an OPERATION — segmented, active, and §036's head above it
    ✦ compacting (4s · 3 of 5 turns)
    ▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯ 60%

